#!/usr/bin/env python3
# apply_strategy_independence.py — fence STRATEGY_INDEPENDENCE_20261015
#
# Goal: any combination of strategies on any licence works on its own — no
# strategy may depend on another one happening to run on the same machine.
# Three gaps left after INDEX_LTP_FEEDER + TMA_TICK_LTP_PUBLISH:
#
# A. BB_V1 / BB_V2 / HA_V1 had NO socket of their own: every tick came through
#    get_ws_engines()[0], the ZerodhaTickEngine only SCALP_V1's selection loop
#    creates. A licence with BB/HA but not SCALP_V1 → those strategies never
#    traded, silently. NEW app/marketdata/shared_tick_feed.py: a feed-only
#    socket (same universe: NIFTY weekly ±800 + BANKNIFTY FUT + indices, same
#    fan-out, same subscribe API, same watchdog; NONE of SCALP_V1's logic),
#    started ONLY when a BB/HA strategy runs and SCALP_V1 does not. Wherever
#    SCALP_V1 runs (your machine) it logs "not needed" and returns — no
#    second socket, byte-identical behaviour.
# B. Velvet panel NIFTY spot reads ltpMap.NIFTY50, which only ORB published.
#    MarketDataContext now aliases NIFTY50 from the (now always live) index
#    feed when nothing else publishes it.
# C. TMA_V1 / TMA_V2 carried legs outside today's ±1500 band were never
#    subscribed (VET already did this). Both tick engines gain ensure_symbols()
#    (builder + token map only — NOT chain meta, so a carried strike never
#    becomes a selection candidate: backtest band parity); both loops call it
#    for the adopted group before engine.start(). Plus the empty-universe
#    alerts in TMA / TMA2 / VET now name the computed vs listed expiries
#    instead of the misleading "only refreshes when MISSING" hint.
#
#  NEW   backend/app/marketdata/shared_tick_feed.py
#        backend/app/marketdata/test_strategy_independence.py
#  EDIT  backend/app/api_server.py                         (1)
#        backend/app/engine/tma2/tma2_tick_engine.py       (1)
#        backend/app/engine/tma/tma_tick_engine.py         (1)
#        backend/app/engine/tma2/tma2_selection_loop.py    (1)
#        backend/app/engine/tma/tma_selection_loop.py      (1)
#        backend/app/engine/vet/vet_selection_loop.py      (1)
#        frontend/src/context/MarketDataContext.jsx        (1)
#  Requires INDEX_LTP_FEEDER_20261015 and TMA_TICK_LTP_PUBLISH_20261015 first.
#  Mirrored to desktop/src-tauri/{backend,frontend}/ when those trees exist.
#  Gates: py_compile, esbuild, imports, the new suite + 8 regression suites.
#  Any failure → every file restored.
#
# Usage: python3 apply_strategy_independence.py [--repo PATH] [--allow-dirty] [--skip-tests] [--skip-esbuild]
# Run ONLY this script.

